  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Forskn.samarb HND 2008-11 - HIV</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Res. coop HND 2008-2011</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Bilalteralt forskningssamarbete med UNAH, det autonoma universitetet i Honduras. Kapacitetsutveckling f&#xF6;r forskning och  forskningsf&#xF6;rvaltning. Inkluderar st&#xF6;d f&#xF6;r IT-utveckling, biblioteksutveckling, kapacitetsutveckling f&#xF6;r forskningsf&#xF6;rvaltning, samt doktorandprogram i geovetenskap och mikrobiologi. 9  sandwich-doktorander i samarbete med svenska institutioner.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bilateral research cooperation with UNAH, the Autonomous University of Honduras. Capacity development for research and research  management. Includes support for ITC-development, library development, capacity building for research management, and PhD programmes in Earth Sciences and Microbiology. 9 sandwich students in cooperation with Swedish institutions.</narrative>
  </description>
